And then they would say, reset, and we would bring the truck back and then we would wait a very long time.

1291
00:46:38.240 --> 00:46:46.880
At the end of the night, they reset us back into the parking lot and we sat there and we sat there in the truck.

1292
00:46:47.160 --> 00:46:48.440
We sat there in the truck.

1293
00:46:48.560 --> 00:46:53.840
And then all of a sudden, we saw everyone driving away in their own cars.

1294
00:46:54.120 --> 00:46:54.760
Oh, no.

1295
00:46:55.160 --> 00:46:57.020
They left us in the truck.

1296
00:46:57.020 --> 00:47:01.300
